    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "e85f78d6-18b7-3e4f-8e6d-ee6f65aa3cde",
                "word": "disport",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "15440556-b763-4f2c-aa92-a9319d67295a",
                        "entry_id": "e85f78d6-18b7-3e4f-8e6d-ee6f65aa3cde",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "disports"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "7f0e8415-28c7-35a0-a598-d8db34e5e900",
                        "entry_id": "e85f78d6-18b7-3e4f-8e6d-ee6f65aa3cde",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Anything which diverts one from serious matters; a game, a pastime, a sport."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "archaic",
                            "countable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "3b37eb97-cc22-4804-b0ab-c70bbfc3d56c",
                                "sense_id": "7f0e8415-28c7-35a0-a598-d8db34e5e900",
                                "text": "It hath beene very frequent with the Kings of England, France, and other Princes, for triall of their man hood, to runne at Iouſts, and fight at Barriers, not onely with forraigners, but with their owne valianteſt Lords and Knights, of which there are various Examples. In theſe Martiall diſports, by the very Law of Armes, theſe Subjects have not onely defended themſelves againſt their kings aſſaults and blowes; but retorted lance for lance, ſtroke for ſtroke, and ſometimes unhorſed, diſarmed, and wounded their Kings, […]"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8639a416-20fa-3280-b821-9a5eddd286e8",
                        "entry_id": "e85f78d6-18b7-3e4f-8e6d-ee6f65aa3cde",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Amusement, entertainment, recreation, relaxation."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "archaic",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "18a2d166-9359-448a-914f-7797b5834e41",
                                "sense_id": "8639a416-20fa-3280-b821-9a5eddd286e8",
                                "text": "And whether they were a bedde or at other maner of disportes me lyst not herof make no mencyon for loue that tyme was not as is now adayes.\n\"And whether they were abed or at other manner of disports, me list not hereof make no mention, for love that time was not as is now-a-days.\""
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "fd382b52-0aa7-33ab-95d0-f07e14756656",
                        "entry_id": "e85f78d6-18b7-3e4f-8e6d-ee6f65aa3cde",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The way one carries oneself; bearing, carriage, deportment."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "obsolete"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "aff86f63-d540-403b-8c05-ad3bfcaecfe1",
                                "sense_id": "fd382b52-0aa7-33ab-95d0-f07e14756656",
                                "text": "[Y]et have I carried myſelf towards thee in ſuch fanciful guiſe of careleſs diſport, that right ſore am I aſhamed now to entreat thy lenity ſeriouſly— […]"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "cb54a1f6-b7fd-3ff2-a504-837d45fbc462",
                        "entry_id": "e85f78d6-18b7-3e4f-8e6d-ee6f65aa3cde",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Bearing, elevation, orientation."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "obsolete"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "cbb7b53c-cb8f-40c6-8bfb-598f5447dd7f",
                                "sense_id": "cb54a1f6-b7fd-3ff2-a504-837d45fbc462",
                                "text": "... shooting a bullet ... out of a Culverin towards the East, and afterwards another, with the same charge, and at the same elevation or disport towards the West."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ea4848de-f9aa-3d68-9c86-820e98a45e5a",
                        "entry_id": "e85f78d6-18b7-3e4f-8e6d-ee6f65aa3cde",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Fun, gaiety, joy, merriment, mirth."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "obsolete",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "42f2aa33-7e78-4411-a43b-aa2ecb63b913",
                        "source_entry_id": "e85f78d6-18b7-3e4f-8e6d-ee6f65aa3cde",
                        "source_sense_description": "pastime — see also pastime",
                        "target_lang_word": "divertissement",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "divertissement",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "26b64377-b039-3f1b-a6c3-557eb67cdfcb",
                                        "entry_id": "ea95d3a8-8593-36f2-9f16-6d9439f438ac",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Récréation, amusement."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6cec204c-ac4c-4f71-b117-f03300233c38",
                                                "sense_id": "26b64377-b039-3f1b-a6c3-557eb67cdfcb",
                                                "text": "Il y a là des cafés maures où les femmes dansent et chantent jusqu'à dix heures du soir, et où l'on fume le Kif toute la nuit, portes closes. Tel est le lieu de divertissement des militaires de la garnison."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b15d6843-c721-4768-bbdb-a9c408a45211",
                                                "sense_id": "26b64377-b039-3f1b-a6c3-557eb67cdfcb",
                                                "text": "Malgré la complaisance avec laquelle ses moindres désirs sont accueillis, elle se sait gardée, et la vie qu’elle mène offrirait peu de plaisir à une jeune fille qui n’aurait pas trouvé comme elle des divertissements dans les livres."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f629f72a-ed9a-4c74-90d5-4cd5905c84cb",
                                                "sense_id": "26b64377-b039-3f1b-a6c3-557eb67cdfcb",
                                                "text": "Le tatouage, en effet, est une institution dans la marine américaine et des heures de service sont spécialement réservées à ce divertissement artistique."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9d546833-4a99-446d-905e-354c507027ed",
                                                "sense_id": "26b64377-b039-3f1b-a6c3-557eb67cdfcb",
                                                "text": "Ainsi, la Bouillotte fut-elle, pendant un certain temps, un divertissement des familles autant que de salon. Les romans de Balzac, vous vous en souvenez, évoquent d'heureux joueurs de bouillotte."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9674f2c8-3f89-3333-a8cd-950e4d63a527",
                                        "entry_id": "ea95d3a8-8593-36f2-9f16-6d9439f438ac",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Émission de télévision dont le but principal est de divertir le téléspectateur."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7b80cd74-296e-3bd9-8414-781a438de70b",
                                        "entry_id": "ea95d3a8-8593-36f2-9f16-6d9439f438ac",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Partie dansée, quelquefois mêlée de chant, d’un opéra ou de toute autre pièce de théâtre."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "especially",
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ccb1fd6d-883d-463e-bd6a-0a55e9e734a3",
                                                "sense_id": "7b80cd74-296e-3bd9-8414-781a438de70b",
                                                "text": "Il y a un divertissement au quatrième acte de cette comédie."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7bf50cb4-182b-3777-824c-69fdf82c8962",
                                        "entry_id": "ea95d3a8-8593-36f2-9f16-6d9439f438ac",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Occupation plus ou moins agréable qui détourne l’homme de lui-même et le fait sortir de lui."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Autrefois"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7b4fa7f6-69eb-4fb3-897b-43569369724d",
                                                "sense_id": "7bf50cb4-182b-3777-824c-69fdf82c8962",
                                                "text": "Pascal expose dans ses Pensées la théorie du divertissement."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "01359eed-0b45-3921-a736-02e9257886fa",
                                        "entry_id": "ea95d3a8-8593-36f2-9f16-6d9439f438ac",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Détournement à son profit."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "dated"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b6baaf63-7eec-40fb-8edd-d5f93af2c47d",
                                                "sense_id": "01359eed-0b45-3921-a736-02e9257886fa",
                                                "text": "[…], certainement il sera puni comme banqueroutier frauduleux, parce qu’il y a dans son fait un divertissement véritable, et que par cette raison il se trouve littéralement compris dans l’art. 10 du tit. II de l’ordonnance de 1673."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "db89c457-366b-3c24-891c-7624d0ea5e58",
                                        "entry_id": "ea95d3a8-8593-36f2-9f16-6d9439f438ac",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Ce qui détourne des choses sérieuses."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "997ead94-a3d4-412a-9480-2cc346ef43e2",
                                                "sense_id": "db89c457-366b-3c24-891c-7624d0ea5e58",
                                                "text": "[…]: c’est qu’on mesure mal l’état de divertissement où sont ravis tant de jeunes gens qui découvrent à la fois les livres et les femmes."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "word_linkages": []
